<BaseLayout
    title={pageTitle}
    description={pageDescription}
>
    <!-- Schema Injection -->
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schemaGraph)} />

    <main class="dcrs-service-page">

        <!-- 1. HERO / OPENING ------------------------------------------------>
        <header class="dcrs-hero-banner">
            <div class="dcrs-hero-banner__scrim"></div>
            <div class="dcrs-container dcrs-hero-banner__inner">
                <nav class="dcrs-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
                    <ol>
                        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/#service">Services</a></li>
                        <li aria-current="page">Car Oil Change Dubai</li>
                    </ol>
                </nav>
                <span class="dcrs-badge">Al Satwa, Dubai · Engine Oil &amp; Filter Service · All Makes &amp; Models</span>
                <h1 class="dcrs-hero-banner__title">
                    Car Oil Change Dubai - Engine Oil &amp; Filter Replacement in Al Satwa
                </h1>
                <p class="dcrs-hero-banner__lead">
                    Keep your engine running smoothly with a professional car oil change in Dubai. At Dubai Car Repair Service in Al Satwa, we provide complete engine oil replacement and fresh oil filter installation for all vehicle makes and models. Our experienced mechanics use the correct manufacturer-approved oil grade—synthetic, semi-synthetic, or mineral—to ensure optimal lubrication, engine cooling, and reliable protection for daily driving in the UAE. Packages start from AED 89.
                </p>
                <div class="dcrs-hero-banner__actions">
                    <a href={phoneHref} class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--solid">
                        <Fragment set:html={icons.phone} /> Call {phoneDisplay}
                    </a>
                    <a href={waHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--wa">
                        <Fragment set:html={icons.chat} /> WhatsApp Us
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- 2. SERVICE OVERVIEW ---------------------------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section dcrs-section--paper" id="service-overview">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-split">
                    <div class="dcrs-split__content">
                        <div class="dcrs-kicker">Service Overview</div>
                        <h2 class="dcrs-heading__title">
                            Car Oil Change Dubai - Engine Protection &amp; Longevity
                        </h2>
                        <div class="dcrs-prose">
                            <p>
                                Engine oil is essential for your vehicle's engine health and longevity. It performs four vital functions: lubricating moving metal parts to minimize friction, dissipating intense combustion heat, cleaning away dirt and carbon by-products, and creating a seal between pistons and cylinder walls. In Dubai's warm climate and stop-and-go city driving, oil breaks down faster over time, gradually losing its protective qualities and allowing harmful sludge to accumulate if not replaced regularly.
                            </p>
                            <p>
